{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124421","id":4838526276,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIGYNRA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124421","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124421.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124421","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124421/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124421/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124421/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0d59d9df141c8ffb4d01efb866999aa7684a0c84","number":124421,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix SpringBoneCollisionCapsule3D gizmo drawing its end arcs inward","user":{"login":"pulppixel","id":26397779,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2Mzk3Nzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26397779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel","html_url":"https://github.com/pulppixel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pulppixel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I found this bug while adding gizmos to my BoneCloth addon.\n\nThe cause is the second for loop in `SpringBoneCollision3DGizmoPlugin::draw_capsule`, which draws the half circles by rotating points around `Vector3::FORWARD`. `FORWARD` is (0, 0, -1), so the top half circle bulges downward (and the bottom one bulges upward).\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"before_master_editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be687806-cae8-4ba3-b76e-2da2eb080dd6\" />\nLeft: `SpringBoneCollisionCapsule3D`. Right: a `CollisionShape3D` of the same size.\n\nGoing through the history, up to 4.5 this was `VECTOR3_FORWARD = Vector3(0, 0, 1)` and it worked correctly. Commit 84c0ec04f3 (\"Core: Integrate semantic constants in math structs\"), which landed in 4.6, replaced it with `Vector3::FORWARD`, and that flipped the direction. The other places it changed are fine; only the second for loop is affected.\n\nCollision itself is not affected. Only the gizmo drawing is wrong.\n\nAfter changing it to `Vector3::BACK`:\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1494\" alt=\"after_master_editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af3f673c-6a66-4ae8-aa71-569053bcf316\" />\n\n---\n\nAI usage: I used AI to go through the git history, to translate this description from Korean, and to help track down the bug.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-13T04:51:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:10:19Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0599f60b026df5d1053fa2cb1776837e0f178463","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"la